 4179|       |     * 2) dRep gets updated only for compressed partitions, and when a repcode gets replaced, will use
 4180|       |     *    the replacement offset value rather than the original repcode to update the repcode history.
 4181|       |     *    dRep also will be the final repcode history sent to the next block.
